/-!
# Internal hom in functor categories

The `functorHom` construction (`Functor.HomObj`, `Functor.functorHom`, `homObjEquiv`,
`functorHomEquiv`, and the enrichment of a functor category over functors into types) originally
developed here has since been upstreamed to Mathlib
(`Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Functor.FunctorHom`). This module is retained as a placeholder that
re-exports that development.
